{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47164","headline":"忆庐山旧居 · 处默","name":"忆庐山旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麤衣粝食老烟霞，勉把衰颜惜岁华。\n独鹤秪爲山客伴，闲云常在野僧家。\n丛生嫩蕨黏松粉，自落乾薪带藓花。\n明月清风旧相得，十年归恨可能赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"处默","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}